      "star_rating": 1,
      "reviewer_name": "Priyanka Choudhury",
      "comment": "I had ordered egg thali..the restaurant called me up to say that the thalis are over and they can only send something else instead ..the options they gave were not acceptable but I had to agree to one of those options since they said refund was not possible in any way!! It is really shameful that even though we are paying such exorbitant amounts for very ordinary food, we as customers do not get the options of a refund! Really unprofessional on the part of the restaurant as well as Zomato! Apparently customers are made to feel that Zomato is doing us some favour by delivering food.",
